# What the sessions working in this repo have learned about this codebase.
# Useful to them, nobody else's business, and not part of the product.
#
# The Brain feature still tells users to commit their own — a project's memory
# travelling with the project is the whole point of it. That is a decision each
# repository makes, and this one has made the other one.
.eaonbrain/

# Instructions for the agents working in this repo. Local guidance, not part of
# the product, and not something to publish alongside it — it stays on the
# machines that need it.
CLAUDE.md

# Agent configuration and project skills, same reasoning as CLAUDE.md: local
# guidance for the sessions working here, not part of the product.
.claude/
